          <div class="faq-section__body">
            <div class="faq-section__body-inner">
              <p class="faq-section__answer">Cancellations before shipment get a full refund minus $200 if the order was stored over 3 months. After shipment, our standard return policy applies. Changes within 24 hours cost nothing. Changes after 24 hours cost $25 per day and may reset your production timeline if they're major (size, reinforcements, gauges, plaques, finishes).</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-section__item" data-faq-item>
          <div class="faq-section__header" data-faq-toggle>
            <p class="faq-section__question">What if I want to change an order within 24hrs?</p>
            <span class="faq-section__toggle">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"/></svg>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-section__body">
            <div class="faq-section__body-inner">
              <p class="faq-section__answer">Changes are completely free with no cost during the first 24 hours after ordering.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-section__item" data-faq-item>
          <div class="faq-section__header" data-faq-toggle>
            <p class="faq-section__question">What if I want to change an order past 24hrs?</p>
            <span class="faq-section__toggle">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"/></svg>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-section__body">
            <div class="faq-section__body-inner">
              <p class="faq-section__answer">It depends on the upgrades selected and how far along production is. Major modifications (size, reinforcements, gauges) reset the production timeline from the approval date, and a $25 daily fee applies for changes made after 24 hours.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-section__item" data-faq-item>
          <div class="faq-section__header" data-faq-toggle>
            <p class="faq-section__question">What is your return policy?</p>
            <span class="faq-section__toggle">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"/></svg>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-section__body">
            <div class="faq-section__body-inner">
              <p class="faq-section__answer">You can return any product within 30 days of delivery for any reason, and we cover return shipping in full. Products must be in original condition with all components included, and safes/vault doors need to be strapped to a pallet in an accessible outdoor area for pickup. After 30 days, our lifetime warranty terms apply instead. Custom or modified products follow the same policy unless stated otherwise. Refunds are issued by check through the mail.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

